asset/images/legacy/

# Contact sheets captured by goldens.html. The RIG is kept (goldens.html,
# js/goldens.js, dev/compare.py) because every phase of the lighting rework is
# verified with it; its output is not, at 2.4MB a sheet and regenerable in
# twenty seconds. Capture a "before" on the tree you are about to change.
goldens/

